#lego-legacy-route 1
# Hot Wheels Stunt Track Driver, from its boot into a race, driving (#38).
#
# The first 7101 flips are a person's own session, recorded from the window:
# through the intro, round the menu's wheel to the crossed flags, along the
# car select, and the click at 7099 that starts the race. The starting line
# is up by flip 7200 with its lights on red, and the car is away by 7240.
#
# The two keys after it are this machine's own: Left at 7400 and Right at
# 7600, which steer the car off its line and into the wall it sparks along.
# A race the keys do not reach looks the same at every flip; one they do is a
# different picture at the same flip.
